  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- Optimized message parsing \"hot path\" for high-performance, zero-allocation scenarios.\n\t\t\t- Implemented lazy field decoding to reduce CPU and boxing overhead.\n\t\t\t- Refactored TryParse to be an instance method on the Frame class to encourage object reuse.\n\t\t\t- Added MemoryMarshal optimizations for bulk array decoding.\n\t\t\t- Added Frame.SetFields and Frame.ToBytes for simplified and safer packet construction and serialization.\n\t\t\t- Added built-in support for System.IO.Pipelines (PipeReader) and ReadOnlySequence for asynchronous, zero-allocation streaming.",
  "repository": "",
  "title": "MAVLinkSharp",
  "verbatimVersion": "1.4.0",
